msgstr "दोबारा स्कैन करें"

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:760 assets/anduinos-oobe:832 assets/anduinos-oobe:840
#: assets/anduinos-oobe:855
msgid "Open Network Settings"
msgstr "नेटवर्क सेटिंग्स खोलें"

